      <data key="d74">(g) devices communicating off-board vehicle generated data used for compliance with this Regulation and OBFCM data, including for the purpose of periodic roadworthiness tests in accordance with Directive 2014/45/EU of the European Parliament and of the Council (26) and technical roadside inspections in accordance with Directive 2014/47/EU of the European Parliament and of the Council (27), and for</data>
