      <data key="d72">requirement_source</data>
      <data key="d73">UN Regulation No 155 (28)</data>
      <data key="d74">Manufacturers shall ensure the secure transmission of data related to emissions and battery durability by taking cybersecurity measures in accordance with UN Regulation No 155 (28).</data>
