      <data key="d74">[TABLE:EU2024-1257.ANNEX-III.TABLE-1] (*) UN Regulation No 154 — Uniform provisions concerning the approval of light duty passenger and commercial vehicles with regards to criteria emissions, emissions of carbon dioxide and fuel consumption and/or the measurement of electric energy consumption and electric range (WLTP), 02 series of amendments.</data>
