      <data key="d74">(**) UN Regulation No 168, Original version. [TABLE:EU2024-1257.ANNEX-III.TABLE-2] (*) UN Regulation No 49, 07 series of amendments. [TABLE:EU2024-1257.ANNEX-III.TABLE-3] (*) SHED: Sealed housing for evaporative determination.</data>
